------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Texture light table (src/HalfLifeTextureLights.h)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The colors and intensities of the Half-Life texture lights are the values of
mapping/compilers/hl_lights.rad ("lights.rad for hl.wad", by Hezus) from the
Sven Co-op SDK, compiled into the converter as data.

